Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:07.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,動作快點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走走走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:17.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽說又抓到一批新鮮的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然真的沒有絲毫察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:24.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我本以為你會正面闖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒想到是潛伏進來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以哥哥希望我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:32.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,硬闖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,潛伏挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:38.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我正好也不擅長打架
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:39.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:41.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該說是不擅長善後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:44.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次我要找他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自然不能被他察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再給他跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫非三郎想讓千秋見的人就是青鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這二人有什麼關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這廢物一無是處
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:00:59.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,警惕性倒是很高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小鬼近不了他身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,心腹也不好偽裝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:06.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要想靠近他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只剩下最後一個辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:06.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:07.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼王大人肯定滿意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼多人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們是不是也能分一口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:14.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-就是\N-是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:37.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:47.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哭什麼哭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哭什麼哭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一群膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:54.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不許哭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:54.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你也不許哭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一把鼻涕一把淚的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:00.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒了我們鬼王大人的胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:04.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,叫你們知道什麼叫生不如死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:05.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別磨磨唧唧了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走快走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:09.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吃人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼界另外三個絕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:17.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可從沒聽說過會吃人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怪不得天界鬼界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:24.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都不待見青鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:35.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走快走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:37.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去晚了鬼王大人紅燒了你們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:04.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別磨蹭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:30.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是要帶去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:49.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:51.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,頭頂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:58.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難道說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是倒掛屍林
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:19.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,喊什麼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:20.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:21.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼叫什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一群沒見過世面的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:31.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這可是我們鬼王的傑作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕是慕情見了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給老子上去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這邊 這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:10.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一個個都給我排好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,過來吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:26.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:32.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都排好隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都別瞎跑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去你的仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你祖祖輩輩世世代代都是仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他就是個瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:15.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我妻兒的命還回來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還命來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一條癩皮狗還上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過是抱了裴種馬的狗腿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真以為他自己有幾斤幾兩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:29.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裴宿現在就是條被流放的野狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢壞我好事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:36.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我叫他被風乾了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也沒人敢收屍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:38.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:39.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然真是他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:45.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:46.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給我老實待著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢跑就煮了你們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:50.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:53.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想死我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:08:59.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有鬼市那群狗東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還真以為老子能看得上他們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那群白眼狼真不要臉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我王屈尊才決定收的鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們倒好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:14.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幫那什麼探花對我們一頓打
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:15.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:18.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可憐大鬼二鬼三鬼四鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都給血雨探花打沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骨灰都飛啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,城主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是我王不屑親自出手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.67,0:09:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不然那鬼東西還能苟活到現在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:45.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:46.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我王三界最強
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我王蓋世第一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打他個探花落跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:56.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灰飛煙滅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灰飛煙滅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過哎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:00.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,五鬼六鬼本來都快到鬼市了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰知撞上那裴狗腿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流放不好好流放
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,閒的蛋疼打什麼鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:25.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,五鬼六鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流放確實是很閒沒錯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:32.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有其祖必有其後
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:34.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都他娘的是狗東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就該先剁了裴茗這匹老種馬的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再剁裴宿的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:40.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對 對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:41.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:43.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,掛在他們廟前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:46.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰拜他們誰就跟他們一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:47.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,步步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流膿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流膿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,同樣是罵人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是風信聽著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可惜了宣姬這麼個烈性好女子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給這不要臉的裴家二狗逮住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:18.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受了天大的委屈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到現在都救不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可惜可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,宣姬烈性不假
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:25.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但好也不真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:27.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:28.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,求而不得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,確實有她可悲之處
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裴郎啊 裴郎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我為了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:33.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,背叛故國
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拋棄一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而你卻讓我變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的心是鐵做的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:44.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都得死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:57.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但之後殺虐成性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:58.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因愛生妒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是也不能全歸錯於裴將軍一人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼狗屁神官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:06.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天界就沒一個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,君吾假正經
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文死賤人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裴家倆爛貨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郎千秋白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,權一真狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:14.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,水師黑心肝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風師賤女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一個個都他媽給我裝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當我不知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:19.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是發現風師大人是個男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有那個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那個什麼絕境鬼王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:29.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不就屈屈是個絕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:31.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然看不起本鬼王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:35.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要讓他們給我磕頭下跪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:36.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:37.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,磕頭下跪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:38.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:41.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上次讓你們辦的事怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:47.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,權一真和裴種馬打起來了沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:48.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:49.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我跟您說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我說我說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:55.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你讓開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-謝\N-你知道個屁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:13:00.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-謝 再聽聽\N-大王我來我來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你來什麼 我先來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:04.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-上天庭有關\N-你們都閃開 我知道的最多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:06.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我來說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:08.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,依照我王之言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:13.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我等把裴茗想要扶持裴宿\N做西方武神的消息傳開了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:16.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在這事在西邊鬧的可大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:17.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再找幾個帶頭的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,混進兩邊給我使勁互噴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:21.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:21.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱們還在北邊扮成奇英殿的信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:26.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,砸了一百多間明光廟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好些信徒看咱們在砸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:32.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們也跟著砸得起勁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就沒一個人懷疑過我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-青鬼本事不大\N-大王英明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卻是很煩人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:43.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回頭有機會得告知帝君一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,提醒兩位神官可別給人挑撥了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,繼續煽火
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:51.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,權一真能忍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:53.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就不信裴種馬還能忍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:57.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:58.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給大王挑個好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:07.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這批質量怎麼這麼差
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:15.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放過孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吃我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:23.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你出來做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這小子怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿下他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂皇族在此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們不打算
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿出幾分敬意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好大的狗膽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢在我面前開這種玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你倒是說說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:59.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是哪門子的仙樂皇族
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安樂王
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安樂王
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找死也不好好補下史書
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:33.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安樂王是仙樂皇室僅存的一支血脈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,早死透了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:36.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼死的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:40.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這小子古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:41.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿下這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:43.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:15.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又是個什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:18.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢在我面前找這種死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別亂跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-都別動\N-谷子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:38.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:40.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:42.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老實點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都別跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都給我老實待著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老實點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:07.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:08.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先待在這
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:11.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:15.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:28.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:31.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都過來給我阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:36.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世上有些東西是阻止不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:38.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,比如
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:40.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太陽落於西方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:41.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,比如
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大象踩死螞蟻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再比如
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要你的狗命
